-**Parameters:**
-*   **Output Dimension:** 61 dimensions per vector [S1].
-*   **Total Dimension:** After concatenation with RGB channels, the total dimension is 64 [S1].
-*   **Architecture:** Built on BigGAN architecture [S1].
